PARITY NOTES (web source is THE specification)
────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  • Reproduced web branches: category select (bug/feature/other), title (5–120) + details
    (20–4000) with on-blur zod-equivalent validation, the "Auto-attached context" panel
    (Page / App version / client), the two consent toggles (recent errors ON with live
    count, log/console tail OFF) with helper text, the submit-error alert, Cancel + Send
    with the "Submitting…" in-flight state + disabled-when-invalid, success → onClose.
  • Limits/trim/console-tail-slice/conditional-attachment ported verbatim from the source.
  • P4 leaf contract honoured truthfully for a write surface: phase loading/empty/error/ready
    from the auto-context bind; connection live/stale/offline (offline disables submit — a
    POST can't proceed offline; stale auto-refreshes the context once); submit lifecycle
    idle/submitting/submitted/failed.
  • i18n: every web `t()` key present in FeedbackModal.strings; three values carry a
    documented native adaptation while preserving the web KEY (userAgent→"Device",
    includeConsole→"log messages", includeErrors `{{count}}`→`%lld`).
  • No view performs I/O — all data flows through the P1/S8 `FeedbackSource` seam; telemetry
    emits `view.opened surface=FeedbackModal` (P1/S11).

